<title>PHILIPPINES: PSBank 1996 net seen about 500 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>PSBank 1996 net seen about 500 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Savings Bank, a unit of Metropolitan Bank and Trust Co, posted a net income of a &quot;little over&quot; 500 million pesos in 1996, up from 315 million pesos in 1995, a bank official told Reuters on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
